Package: situcraft
Type: Package
Title: Remote Control of a Running 'SituCraft'
Version: 0.9.0
Authors@R: person("Robert", "McDermott", email = "robert.c.mcdermott@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Drives 'SituCraft', a workbench for imaging spatial
    transcriptomics (10x Genomics Xenium output), from R: every action an AI
    agent can take in 'SituCraft' (open bundles, segment, cluster and label
    cells, ask which cells meet conditions, run spatial analyses and cohort
    comparisons, read results, show the tissue, write files) is an R function
    that the open 'SituCraft' window performs, so the analysis stays visible
    and recorded. Tables come back as data frames and pictures as files.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
URL: https://github.com/robert-mcdermott/situcraft
BugReports: https://github.com/robert-mcdermott/situcraft/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    curl,
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
